WEBVTT

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.900
You guys wanna check out that festival today?

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.080
-I'm in!
-I'm in!

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.710
I heard they have a merry-go-round
in addition to the street stalls this year.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.280
Oh, they're getting serious.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.250
I'm excited for the fireworks too.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.960
I'll have so much fun, I'll miss my curfew.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.260
It is a festival, you can be a little late.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.410
-That's true.
-Let's enjoy ourselves.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.300
What?

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.930
Oh, no.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.380
I found what I was looking for.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:33.850
Why don't we get going, Teria?

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.180
Okay.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.930
That was close.

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:45.160
It's probably bad to let them hear it,
even if it is a joke.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.120
They're basically proxy teachers.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:50.280
These prefects with their perfect grades,

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.210
popularity and authority...

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:55.030
I wonder how they view the world?

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:30.840
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:39.690
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:45.690
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:51.030
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:56.200
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.960
So that I can protect you

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:05.460
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:11.010
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:16.060
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:23.020
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.390
Romio and the Prefect

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:29.620
A festival?
Romio and the Prefect

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:29.840
Romio and the Prefect

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:35.390
Yep! Some students were giggling about
there being a festival near campus.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:37.740
Want to come hang out with us?

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:43.260
Unthinkable. We are prefects.
We are to protect and guide the students.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.280
Where there's a festival, there's trouble.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.700
I believe it's our job to monitor it as well.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:54.650
I need to wrap up this request for punishment
I'm submitting to the school.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.250
You two, go oversee the festival.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:01.410
Exercise your power and
dole out punishment to the merry-makers.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.050
That's a prefect's job.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.410
A festival?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.400
Today, the Harvest Festival
is just across the lake from campus.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.640
There's food stands and fireworks.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:20.680
I've heard of it. We're allowed to attend it too.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:23.940
Yeah, so...

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.930
If you want, we could go together.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:27.110
Sounds good.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:30.160
You're probably right. There's no way...

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.160
I just had to ask, though.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.970
-You're okay with it?
-Hey, you're being too loud!

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.190
But...

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:41.450
We might want to hold off
on the Julio disguise this time.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.050
That would make visiting the stands together
pretty tough.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:48.580
I think I'll probably visit them with my dorm mates.

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.470
It can't be helped!

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.270
It's not like I cared about some stupid festival.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:59.520
I didn't want to watch the fireworks anyway!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:02.090
Your face is pretty easy to read.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:06.570
I'll make sure I can slip away for the fireworks.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.350
Let's watch them together.

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:12.980
You're desperate to watch them together?
Well, I've got no choice but to accommodate you.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.490
-Never mind.
-I was kidding! Please!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:18.630
Then I'll see you when the time is right.

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.080
Yes! I did it!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.250
Festival date!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.490
Look out below!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.400
Who are you? Why were you in that tree?

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:43.950
Could you please let me go?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:47.760
Your hand's touching it. That's sexual harassment.

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:51.020
Oh, sorry. I didn't realize that was your breast.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.910
You're a rather rude fellow, aren't you?

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.400
Don't you know who I am?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:00.750
Why would I know some middle-school brat?

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.530
Shouldn't you be thanking me for saving you?

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:05.780
Ouch! Let go!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.630
Hey, you! Come on!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:10.890
Big sis Kochou's in trouble! I've got him.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:15.800
Nice one, Teria!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.350
That did hurt my butt a little.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:21.770
Hey, take a good look at our uniforms, dummy.

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:26.270
We may be 14 years old,
but we're second-year high schoolers.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.180
We're the grade-skipping twins!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.610
These brats are my upperclassmen?

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:33.700
It's not like we were just here fooling around.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.560
We were saving a cat.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:40.790
If you hadn't suddenly come from under that bench,
I could've guaranteed him a safe landing.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.000
Inuzuka!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.420
What are you up to?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:48.010
These weird brats were just picking a fight with me.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:50.450
Weird brats?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.700
They're pissed about something. Such a pain.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.960
-I'm terribly sorry about Inuzuka!
-Hasuki?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.100
Inuzuka, you have to bow!

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.350
Yeah, right, not to these punks.

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.600
They're not just some kids!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.340
These two are prefects!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.880
That's the expert pharmaceutical student, Kochou!

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.270
Kochou Wang
Second-Year Prefect

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:10.720
Thanks for the introduction!
Second-Year Prefect
Kochou Wang

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:10.730
Thanks for the introduction!

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.260
And the expert engineering student, Teria!

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.040
Teria Wang
Second-Year Prefect
And the expert engineering student, Teria!

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:15.570
Second-Year Prefect
Teria Wang

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:16.730
Hello.
Second-Year Prefect
Teria Wang

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.850
Prefects?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:20.360
Don't you know?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:25.210
If a prefect sets their sights on you,
you'll start to lose lots of liberties.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.990
On campus, that equates to death!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:29.840
What's the matter? Scared?

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.130
Don't kid yourself.

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.590
I can't stand you pompous, hard-headed prefects.

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:37.010
You two are still just brats, you know.

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.000
-Snot-nosed, pants-pooping brats.
-Inuzuka!

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.750
I can't let that one go.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:46.260
Age makes no difference.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:52.030
If you've been gifted with talent,
you must use it to guide and protect others.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.620
That's our motto!

00:06:56.700 --> 00:07:00.160
By the way, Romio Inuzuka, the problematic child...

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:01.950
You know who I am?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:06.230
You seemed to be having some secret conversation
beneath that bench.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.610
I wonder what it is you're up to.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:12.800
Did they see our secret meeting?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:17.620
No, if they knew I was talking to Persia,
they wouldn't bother trying to fluster me.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:22.630
If I can just pull the wool over their eyes,
it'll be fine. I can do this.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.640
I was...

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:27.480
talking to my ant friends under the bench!

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.590
I was like, "See you guys at the festival!"

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.740
-Inuzuka...
-Poor thing.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:38.320
What a lonely boy.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:39.890
I guess they're pitying me.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:44.370
I have to help the teachers today
and can't go to the festival. Will you be okay?

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:48.750
-Should I introduce you to some friends?
-Come on, I have friends! Leave me alone!

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.750
-Are you really okay?
-The ants, huh?

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:53.970
He's pretty interesting after all.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.140
Looks like I got away with it somehow.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:02.140
I don't want to get involved with them.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:06.060
Welcome home! Would you like some food?

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:11.940
A bath? Or, perhaps, the two of us?

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.650
Just kidding. Did I get your hopes up?

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:18.360
Well, did I?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.280
Why are you here? Get out!

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:23.490
We just came to hang out. Don't get so mad.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.120
Where's the sequel to this?

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:27.620
You just came into my room
and started reading my manga?

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:28.980
Are you really prefects?

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:33.660
On another note, we found this.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.240
What's this?

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.620
Why does a Touwa citizen have a rosary?

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.990
Give it back!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.250
Crap. These two are on to me.

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.630
What are you doing to my little sister?

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:55.760
-Sorry. Wait, are you two really twins?
-What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:02.780
Anyway, your panic tells me
that there's some secret to this rosary.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:10.480
I've got some dangerous ones after me now.
If I don't do something, our date will--

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.530
-Here you go!
-Thank you!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.030
With them sealed up tight--

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.460
Why are you out here?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:21.380
Don't point the fire extinguisher at us!

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.540
What's all the damn fuss?

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.970
Hey, Maru! Let's go to the festival!

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:31.230
-I'm not going.
-Don't be like that. It'll be fun!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:36.900
He ran away.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.690
There really is something going on with him.

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.680
It's starting!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.450
Let's get there quick!

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:46.540
Time to play the day away!

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.440
Teria.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:51.790
Let's go to the festival too.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:52.940
Really?

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.130
We have to find Romio.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:59.570
Besides, Airu told us we have to monitor the students.

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:04.350
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.490
Teria.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.490
Remember, we're prefects.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:45.750
Yeah. I know.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.770
Where are some merrymaking students?

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.320
He's making tons of merry!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:11:00.130
It's too early for fireworks,
but I'd better go find some ideal vantage points.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.360
I can't wait.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.520
We found you, Romio!

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.160
You guys? You're still following me?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:09.990
No. This is work.

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.590
We're on patrol!

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:15.040
We prefects have the authority
to punish Black Doggy students

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.580
who are having too good a time
and messing around!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:19.990
Do I look like I'm having a good time?

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:22.930
It's all over your face.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:26.220
I won't be able to meet with Persia
with these two on my case.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.000
-Hell if I care!
-He ran away.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:31.180
We're going after him, Teria!

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:39.860
Maru! Let's toss some rings!

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.020
Nope.

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.010
-Scoop some goldfish?
-No way.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.070
-Should we get some chocolate bananas?
-Huh?

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.510
What, you want one?

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.270
Lady Persia!

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:50.160
Look at this.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.490
We've prepared a box seat for you
for optimal firework viewing.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:56.040
It's six meters high!
Be my guest.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.250
I'm not good with heights.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.650
I don't want to sit on that.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.030
My, what a wonderful view!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.780
Hey! You thieving cat!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.660
-I didn't catch that. What?
-Nothing.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.930
-Now's my chance.
-Hey, hey, Maru.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:10.660
Let's get chocolate bananas! Please!

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.830
-Shut up!
-Maru! Want a candy apple?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.290
I don't!

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.800
I'm going home. You two have fun.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.520
Maru's been down in the dumps lately.

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:26.190
I thought a change of pace would help him out.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.930
He's sad because he was rejected.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.820
Maybe he just needs to meet a girl.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:33.540
Guess we're not enough.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:39.000
-Actually, I'll stick around.
-Maru's back!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.880
-Let's ride the merry-go-round!
-Yeah, right!

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:43.630
We lost him.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:46.590
We've searched the entire festival.

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:48.160
Could he be...

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.470
over there?

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.140
Maybe?

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:56.360
Where's Inuzuka?

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.480
Persia! Persia!

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.050
You scared me!

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:02.650
Sorry, have you been waiting long?

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.560
Crouch down over here.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.550
What's the matter?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.310
Goodness! Where did that Romio run off to?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.150
Why are those prefects...?

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.970
Stuff happened and now they're chasing me.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:15.560
For now, let's get--

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.690
That's not him!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.700
Where is he?

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.800
The fireworks are going to start!

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.200
We've got to lose them.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.190
I guess we lost Romio.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:48.220
The way he freaked out about the rosary,
there's something to it.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:54.320
Let's give up and go back to patrolling.

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.660
You're right.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.910
Airu did ask us to do that.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.610
We hid here at the last second,
but, man, is this risky!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:11.370
-Don't move around so much.
-Sorry.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.120
Oh, no. She smells nice. And she's soft in places.

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:15.910
Go ahead and embrace her!

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.620
Devil Inuzuka
Go ahead and embrace her!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:18.630
You mustn't! She'll scorn you!
Devil Inuzuka
Go ahead and embrace her!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:21.130
Devil Inuzuka
You mustn't! She'll scorn you!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.690
-If I may interrupt...
-Who are you?

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:28.260
Please try to understand my dilemma of
wanting to touch girls, but being unable to do so.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.730
Bad Answer Guy
Bad Answer Guy

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:30.890
Who cares, loser!
Bad Answer Guy
Bad Answer Guy

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:33.150
-Go home!
-That's right!

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:36.390
I can't take it anymore!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.390
Those two need to go somewhere else quick.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.380
Princess Char, about how much more are you...?

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:50.110
I want one of everything here!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.300
Isn't this fun, Maru?

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:54.490
It's not fun!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.010
-Big sis...
-No.

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.510
Those two...

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.510
-Hey, what the--?
-What's going on?

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.140
-Yeah, get him!
-Don't be foolish!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.780
My stand is going to be ruined!

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:21.280
Knock it off, do you want the fireworks to be canceled?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:22.900
Stop it!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.870
Don't let the fireworks be canceled!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.030
Don't worry.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.660
-Hey, you two!
-Huh?

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:35.260
It's against school rules to disrupt the festival
and cause harm to civilians.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:40.540
Kochou and Teria will now dispense punishment
with our authority as prefects!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:46.420
-Who cares if you're prefects?
-You're asking for it, ladies!

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.980
Be a good boy, okay?

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.460
-That was quick!
-I'll remember this!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:09.360
Way to go, prefects!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.990
They're exemplary. Always helping others.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:17.990
Of course, they're prefects!
They exist in a different world than ours.

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:28.740
I think I get it now.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:30.520
Could you wait here for a minute?

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:33.570
Wait! Where are you going?

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:41.410
Romio must really not be here.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.780
Oh, well, let's just give up.

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.730
What was that for?

00:16:47.410 --> 00:16:50.830
You were hot on my tail for a while there.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:53.550
I can't just let you leave after that.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:56.880
Let's have a match. A stall competition!

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.240
If I win, you have to grovel before me.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.930
Idiot! Prefects don't play childish games!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.260
Not games, battles.

00:17:04.260 --> 00:17:06.880
If you refuse, I'll destroy this stall.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:10.980
Could it be you're scared to face me?

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.760
Bring it on!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.140
You're leaning too far!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.280
Quit hanging from me!

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:23.020
It's a handicap!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.910
A speed-eating contest.
Strength will have no bearing here!

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.400
You asked for it!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.250
Too easy!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.760
Stop moving around so mu--!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.140
It looks like we're the victors!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.670
I ate too much pie.

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.190
Damn. Two on one isn't fair.

00:17:57.190 --> 00:18:00.740
-Hey, what should we do next?
-That's the end.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.060
I see...

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:10.820
Anyway, the terms of my loss
weren't decided, were they?

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:14.190
Call me if you want to play again someday.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.200
I'll take you on again then.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.130
You wanted friends
to hang out with at the festival, right?

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:23.550
-What?
-Just say so. Don't beat around the bush.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:26.410
-That's not--
-I heard from someone in your class.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.140
Those two?

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:33.270
-They're always together, aren't they?
-Well, they are prefects.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.420
You can't just casually approach them.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:40.430
You're doing a fine job of being prefects.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:45.660
You're both kids,
so you can spoil yourselves once in a while.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.070
Don't treat us like kids!
We're adults now!

00:18:57.070 --> 00:19:01.570
-I'm sure you're the one who wants friends, ant boy!
-Shut it.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:05.220
Next time we're free, we're coming to hang out!
You better be ready!

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:06.450
You better be.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:09.710
-Bye-bye!
-Bye-bye!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.600
Now, let's go!

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.060
Let's go.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:15.900
Those little brats.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.260
One okonomiyaki plea-- What?

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:25.160
Crap. If I don't get back there fast,
the fireworks will...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:02.740
I-- I didn't make it.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:17.880
Persia, are you mad?

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:20.670
No. Not at all.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:22.630
Did you see the fireworks?

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.680
Oh, I saw, through this hole.

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.970
She's super mad.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:30.830
This was my first time watching fireworks from a barrel.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.650
I'm so sorry!

00:20:32.650 --> 00:20:35.430
You came along with me this far...

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:38.520
I know an apology isn't enough.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:43.940
I was joking. I'm not really angry.

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:46.350
I mean, I did get to see a few things.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:49.700
Those girls wanted to have fun, too.

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:54.660
We didn't get to watch fireworks together,
but I saw a softer side of you,

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:56.460
and that's enough for me.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.950
Persia.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.920
There will be more chances to see fireworks.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.290
Oh, that's right.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:05.840
Here's something we can do in place of the fireworks.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.600
How simple, just like you.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.850
If you're going to complain...

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:17.880
-I love...
-Love?

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.100
...handheld fireworks.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:22.880
Right.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.510
We got to enjoy the festival thanks to Romio.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:31.480
He's totally falling for me.

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.520
But I already like someone else, so too bad.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:39.250
Do you think Romio will enter
the seasonal prefect selection?

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:40.530
I wonder...

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.460
If Romio became a prefect,

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.840
there'd be a huge revolution at this school.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:50.260
But, we've got Airu.

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.290
That should do it.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:06.970
Black Doggy Student Representative
Airu Inuzuka

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:33.680
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:41.690
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:48.990
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:22:49.150 --> 00:22:55.620
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:03.840
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:10.180
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:17.430
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:19.640
I want to support you

00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:27.480
With everything I have

00:23:27.650 --> 00:23:35.580
Until the world can one day change

00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:40.490
Thank you for watching this episode.

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:42.110
Give it more gusto!

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:43.910
You have something I don't, Teria.

00:23:43.910 --> 00:23:46.580
-Something only I have?
-I'm talking about boobs!

00:23:46.580 --> 00:23:47.230
Next time: "Romio and Char and the Present."

00:23:47.230 --> 00:23:49.200
Romio and Char and the Present

00:23:49.200 --> 00:23:51.990
You're scary, sis.
Romio and Char and the Present
